// Copy to go.work (gitignored) with `scripts/make_work.sh`, or by hand. Covers all seven modules and
// builds from a clean clone: every module resolves goinfer and aikit from this checkout or the proxy.
// docs/layout.md explains each module; RELEASING.md says why the workspace is mandatory for cross-module work.
go 1.27.2

use (
	.
	./backend/webgpu
	./backend/cuda
	./backend/metal
	./demo/agent
	./apps/sdktest
	./apps/site
)

// Optional, only when you edit a local aikit checkout (nobara keeps one at ../aikit/aikit; a clean worktree has none,
// and a `use` of a missing directory breaks every build). Uncomment and fix the path:
// use ../aikit/aikit
